## 💼 PHASE 5: Update OrderService (45 min) - MAJOR CHANGES

### File 13: `service/OrderService.java`

**Copilot Prompt - Part 1:**
```java
Update createOrder method in OrderService:

Current flow:
1-7. Create order, calculate amounts, save order
8. Execute async operations

NEW flow:
1-7. Create order (same as before)
8. Calculate shipping fee (call ShippingServiceClient.calculateFee())
9. Update order.shipping with calculated fee
10. Recalculate order.total
11. Save order again
12. Call PaymentServiceClient.createPayment()
13. If paymentMethod == VNPAY:
    - Save payment.paymentUrl to order.paymentUrl
    - Return OrderResponse with paymentUrl
14. If paymentMethod == COD:
    - Execute async operations immediately
    - Return OrderResponse without paymentUrl

Dependencies to inject:
- PaymentServiceClient
- ShippingServiceClient
- CartServiceClient (existing)
- NotificationServiceClient (existing)
```

**Expected Code - Part 1 (createOrder):**
```java
@Service
@RequiredArgsConstructor
@Transactional
@Slf4j
public class OrderService {

    private final OrderRepository orderRepository;
    private final PaymentServiceClient paymentServiceClient;
    private final ShippingServiceClient shippingServiceClient;
    private final CartServiceClient cartServiceClient;
    private final NotificationServiceClient notificationServiceClient;

    public OrderResponse createOrder(CreateOrderRequest request, String userId) {
        log.info("Creating order for user: {}", userId);

        // 1-7. Build order (existing logic)
        Order order = buildOrderFromRequest(request, userId);
        order.setStatus(OrderStatus.PENDING);
        order.setPaymentStatus(PaymentStatus.PENDING);

        // Calculate initial subtotal
        BigDecimal subtotal = calculateSubtotal(order.getItems());
        order.setSubtotal(subtotal);

        // Apply discount if any
        BigDecimal discount = calculateDiscount(subtotal, request.getCouponCode());
        order.setDiscount(discount);

        // Save order first time (to get ID)
        Order savedOrder = orderRepository.save(order);

        // 8. Calculate shipping fee
        CalculateFeeRequest feeRequest = CalculateFeeRequest.builder()
            .toDistrictId(request.getShippingAddress().getDistrictId())
            .toWardCode(request.getShippingAddress().getWardCode())
            .weight(calculateTotalWeight(order.getItems()))
            .build();

        CalculateFeeResponse feeResponse = shippingServiceClient.calculateFee(feeRequest);

        // 9. Update shipping fee
        savedOrder.setShipping(feeResponse.getFee());

        // 10. Calculate tax and total
        BigDecimal taxableAmount = subtotal.subtract(discount);
        BigDecimal tax = taxableAmount.multiply(new BigDecimal("0.08"));  // 8% tax
        savedOrder.setTax(tax);

        BigDecimal total = subtotal.subtract(discount).add(feeResponse.getFee()).add(tax);
        savedOrder.setTotal(total);

        // 11. Save order with updated amounts
        savedOrder = orderRepository.save(savedOrder);

        // 12. Create payment
        CreatePaymentRequest paymentRequest = CreatePaymentRequest.builder()
            .orderId(savedOrder.getId().toString())
            .orderNumber(savedOrder.getOrderNumber())
            .userId(userId)
            .amount(savedOrder.getTotal())
            .paymentMethod(request.getPaymentMethod().name())
            .description("Payment for order " + savedOrder.getOrderNumber())
            .build();

        PaymentResponse paymentResponse = paymentServiceClient.createPayment(paymentRequest);

        // Save payment info to order
        savedOrder.setPaymentId(paymentResponse.getPaymentNumber());

        // 13-14. Handle based on payment method
        if (request.getPaymentMethod() == PaymentMethod.VNPAY) {
            // VNPAY: Save payment URL and return
            savedOrder.setPaymentUrl(paymentResponse.getPaymentUrl());
            orderRepository.save(savedOrder);

            log.info("Order created with VNPay payment: {}", savedOrder.getOrderNumber());

            // Return response with payment URL
            return OrderResponse.builder()
                .id(savedOrder.getId())
                .orderNumber(savedOrder.getOrderNumber())
                .status(savedOrder.getStatus())
                .total(savedOrder.getTotal())
                .paymentUrl(paymentResponse.getPaymentUrl())  // Frontend will redirect here
                .build();

        } else {
            // COD: Execute async operations immediately
            orderRepository.save(savedOrder);
            executePostOrderOperations(savedOrder);

            log.info("Order created with COD payment: {}", savedOrder.getOrderNumber());

            // Return response without payment URL
            return OrderResponse.builder()
                .id(savedOrder.getId())
                .orderNumber(savedOrder.getOrderNumber())
                .status(savedOrder.getStatus())
                .total(savedOrder.getTotal())
                .build();
        }
    }

    // Helper methods
    private Integer calculateTotalWeight(List<OrderItem> items) {
        // Calculate based on items (default: 1000g per item)
        return items.size() * 1000;
    }

    private BigDecimal calculateSubtotal(List<OrderItem> items) {
        return items.stream()
            .map(item -> item.getPrice().multiply(new BigDecimal(item.getQuantity())))
            .reduce(BigDecimal.ZERO, BigDecimal::add);
    }

    private BigDecimal calculateDiscount(BigDecimal subtotal, String couponCode) {
        // Implement coupon logic here
        return BigDecimal.ZERO;
    }
}
```

