**Copilot Prompt - Part 2:**
```java
Update executePostOrderOperations method:

NEW flow for COD:
1. Clear cart (existing)
2. Confirm order immediately:
   - Update status to CONFIRMED
   - Update paymentStatus to PENDING (will be paid on delivery)
   - Set confirmedAt
3. Create shipment with COD amount = order.total
4. Save tracking number to order
5. Send notification

NEW flow for VNPAY (called from confirmPayment method):
1. Clear cart
2. Already confirmed (status updated in confirmPayment)
3. Create shipment with COD amount = 0 (already paid online)
4. Save tracking number to order
5. Send notification

Update method signature to accept paymentMethod parameter
```

**Expected Code - Part 2 (executePostOrderOperations):**
```java
@Async
@Transactional(propagation = Propagation.REQUIRES_NEW)
public void executePostOrderOperations(Order order) {
    log.info("Executing post-order operations for: {}", order.getOrderNumber());

    try {
        // 1. Clear cart
        cartServiceClient.clearCart(order.getUserId());
        log.info("Cart cleared for user: {}", order.getUserId());

        // 2. If COD, confirm order immediately
        if (order.getPaymentMethod() == PaymentMethod.COD) {
            order.setStatus(OrderStatus.CONFIRMED);
            order.setPaymentStatus(PaymentStatus.PENDING);  // Will be paid on delivery
            order.setConfirmedAt(LocalDateTime.now());
            orderRepository.save(order);
            log.info("Order confirmed (COD): {}", order.getOrderNumber());
        }

        // 3. Create shipment (only if order is confirmed)
        if (order.getStatus() == OrderStatus.CONFIRMED) {
            CreateShipmentRequest shipmentRequest = CreateShipmentRequest.builder()
                .orderId(order.getId().toString())
                .orderNumber(order.getOrderNumber())
                .toName(order.getCustomerName())
                .toPhone(order.getCustomerPhone())
                .toAddress(extractAddress(order.getShippingAddress()))
                .toDistrictId(extractDistrictId(order.getShippingAddress()))
                .toWardCode(extractWardCode(order.getShippingAddress()))
                .weight(calculateTotalWeight(order.getItems()))
                .codAmount(
                    order.getPaymentMethod() == PaymentMethod.COD
                        ? order.getTotal()      // COD: shipper collects money
                        : BigDecimal.ZERO       // VNPAY: already paid online
                )
                .note("Order: " + order.getOrderNumber())
                .build();

            CreateShipmentResponse shipmentResponse = shippingServiceClient.createShipment(shipmentRequest);

            // 4. Save tracking number
            order.setShipmentId(shipmentResponse.getShipmentNumber());
            order.setTrackingNumber(shipmentResponse.getTrackingNumber());
            orderRepository.save(order);

            log.info("Shipment created: {}, tracking: {}",
                shipmentResponse.getShipmentNumber(),
                shipmentResponse.getTrackingNumber());
        }

        // 5. Send notification
        notificationServiceClient.sendOrderConfirmation(order);
        log.info("Notification sent for order: {}", order.getOrderNumber());

    } catch (Exception e) {
        log.error("Error in post-order operations for: {}", order.getOrderNumber(), e);
        // Don't fail the order, just log
    }
}

// Helper methods for address parsing
private String extractAddress(String shippingAddressJson) {
    // Parse JSON or return full address string
    // Implement based on how you store address
    return "123 Le Loi";  // TODO: Parse from JSON
}

private Integer extractDistrictId(String shippingAddressJson) {
    // Parse JSON to get district ID
    return 1542;  // TODO: Parse from JSON
}

private String extractWardCode(String shippingAddressJson) {
    // Parse JSON to get ward code
    return "21012";  // TODO: Parse from JSON
}
```

