## 🔄 COMPLETE FLOW DIAGRAM

```
USER PLACES ORDER
       ↓
┌──────────────────────────────────────┐
│  OrderService.createOrder()          │
│  1-7. Build order                    │
│  8. Calculate shipping fee ←─────────┼─→ Shipping Service
│  9-11. Update order amounts          │
│  12. Create payment ←────────────────┼─→ Payment Service
└──────────────────┬───────────────────┘
                   │
        ┌──────────┴──────────┐
        ↓                     ↓
    VNPAY?                  COD?
        │                     │
        ↓                     ↓
┌───────────────┐    ┌────────────────┐
│ Return with   │    │ Confirm order  │
│ paymentUrl    │    │ immediately    │
│               │    │                │
│ Frontend      │    │ Execute async  │
│ redirects     │    │ operations     │
│ to VNPay      │    └────────────────┘
└───────┬───────┘
        │
        ↓
┌───────────────────────────┐
│ User pays on VNPay        │
└───────┬───────────────────┘
        │
        ↓
┌───────────────────────────────────────┐
│ VNPay redirects to Payment Service    │
│ Callback                              │
└───────┬───────────────────────────────┘
        │
        ↓
┌───────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Payment Service verifies signature    │
│ Updates payment status                │
│ Calls Order Service ←─────────────────┼─→ POST /api/orders/{id}/payment-confirmed
└───────┬───────────────────────────────┘
        │
        ↓
┌───────────────────────────────────────┐
│ OrderService.confirmPayment()         │
│ - Update order status: CONFIRMED      │
│ - Update payment status: SUCCESS      │
│ - Execute async operations            │
└───────────────────────────────────────┘
        │
        ↓
┌───────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Async Operations (@Async)             │
│ 1. Clear cart                         │
│ 2. Create shipment (COD = 0) ←────────┼─→ Shipping Service
│ 3. Send notification ←────────────────┼─→ Notification Service
└───────────────────────────────────────┘
```

